{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"There are 5 core principals... things you would need to respect... and be willing to fight for....\" he pauses a moment to eat another berry \"First is life.  Since all life is tied togeather to take a life is to harm yourself.  Taking life should never be easy... but there are times it is a necessary good.\" he pauses and watches finn's reaction","created_at":"2021-07-24T15:59:16.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868522735222014013","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"How does this work with redcoats, protecting others, and self defense? Also lives of what. Intellect devourers greatly need to be exterminated, that's like a known fact I think after last night\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T16:01:20.631000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868523256079056946","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he smiles \"I think some of the other aspects will answer those things.... But in general... if taking a life saves more lives than would be lost.... then it is the right thing to do.\"  he pauses a moment \"As for intellect devourer.... that's not life.... that's servitude.\" he pauses \"Freedom is a very important aspect to me, in fact is one of the other tenants.... and I have no love for the aberrations.  They don't just enslave beings.... they mutilate their bodies, mins, and in some cases souls.  Ending an aberration is freeing the creature if they can be freed... and saving lives.... those horrors only want to enslave us all.... and I wont have any part of subjugation again\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T16:06:18.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868524504941477981","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
