{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Another aspect I guide people towards is mercy.... It is easier to act out of fear than mercy.... If you can... give someone a second chance.... If you think they are true in needing one.... but if they betray that.... do not harm them out of fear.... have compassion for them... even if you have to kill them.  No one wakes up thinking how they can be a villain that day.... we all are just doing the best we can.... so as long as you keep in mind that others are doing what they think right... you'll always have mercy.... even if its a mercy killing.... like the aberrations I mentioned a moment ago\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T16:12:06.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868525965985316864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
